        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_01",
      "hash64": "D97FE04188CF308D",
      "text": "那麼，\\n我們立刻開始吧。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_02",
      "hash64": "D97FDD4188CF2B74",
      "text": "打頭陣的四天王\\n就是辛俐姐姐我！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_03",
      "hash64": "D97FDE4188CF2D27",
      "text": "我會好～好地疼[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一番的。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就好好地……加把勁啊～！[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_04",
      "hash64": "D97FDB4188CF280E",
      "text": "唉～太扯了，太扯了，\\n這哪有可能贏得了哪。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_05",
      "hash64": "D97FDC4188CF29C1",
      "text": "這可是連打輸的我都覺得\\n神清氣爽的痛快對戰咧。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_06",
      "hash64": "D97FD94188CF24A8",
      "text": "能夠突破\\n技能測驗的訓練家，\\r\\n就只有那麼一小撮。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_07",
      "hash64": "D97FDA4188CF265B",
      "text": "不過，是[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話，\\n說不定真的是說不定喔。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
